{"server":"tw","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_01_end","groupId":"act40side","stageId":"act40side_01","title":"一清二白","storyCode":"OR-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"235b3021cd057bac1db8447655530dfb1bfb2c1cf3d9052cb5264755ba299d59","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"驚蟄回到大理寺參與對前大理寺少卿虞澄的審決。虞澄自首，並自稱是之前火燒卷牘庫的兇手。他不合邏輯的舉動令驚蟄懷疑他別有用心，於是，驚蟄決意重拾虞澄曾查過的舊案。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年輕的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您要帶我看什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅定的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"加緊幾步，快到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溪邊踏雪，古梅聞香，雖然難得，但山下也並非沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想來只有這從峰頂俯瞰城市煙火的滿眼景色，值得您特意繞路攀山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滿城煙火又有什麼好看的？麟青硯，我想帶你看的，是這棵松樹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……勁松歷寒，不損其翠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是這些誰都會說的空話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這棵松樹是我前往百灶就職前，親手栽下的。我種下這棵樹時，心中所想，應當與你毫無二致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多年過去，我已非當初那個我，這棵樹也不再是當初那棵樹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚輩不明白……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，你現在只需要看到它，記住它就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"青硯……大理寺很適合你。你將來會成為一名出色的少卿，甚至是大理寺卿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些案件對你來說不會是什麼問題，你真正需要思考的問題只有一個——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能否擔得起真相的分量？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，不用你現在明白。將來，你會時不時想起這棵松樹，當你想起足夠多次，有些事你自然就會明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我死了，你砍下它。用它的木，做我的棺材。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虞前輩……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，高處不勝寒，該回去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"數載風雪，朝夕瞬華。\n我又一次想起了那棵松樹，和那條鋪滿雪的山徑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g9_dalitemple"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕微的鼾聲）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……幾時了？嫌疑人招了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"解真御史，這樣嚴肅的場合，還請注意言行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"這是大理寺內部的家務事，這種場合肅政院就是來走個過場，無所謂的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"不過今天這個審決的場面，倒是有趣……那位好脾氣的大理寺卿大人，我還從來沒見她發過這麼大的火。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虞澄！你曾經也在大理寺為官，在這面銅鏡下發過誓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這大理寺決院，難道是讓你撒潑耍橫的地方？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是冤枉，大理寺卿大人該問的都問了，我該招的也都招了，難道還不夠配合？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上個月十五號，夜裡丑時三刻，大理寺卷牘庫南區被人放了一把火。那把火就是我親手放的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荒唐！火災發生時，你正被關押候審，如何縱火？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這件事是你謀劃的，你的同謀又是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼同謀，不過確實有一個幫手……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一隻羽獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那天晚上，有一隻受傷的羽獸落在我那間牢獄的窗邊。我餵了牠幾粒米、一點清水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那羽獸頗有靈性，我救了牠，牠願意幫我一個忙。我給了牠一根點燃的稻草，讓牠飛到卷牘庫去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噗——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳……咳……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虞澄，決院裡的人都沒有工夫陪你胡鬧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不敢胡鬧，你問我什麼，我答什麼就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好，既然你堅稱是自己放的火，那就把細節交代清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是什麼種類的羽獸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我哪認得是什麼品種的羽獸，只記得通體烏黑，不見一根雜毛……與天下人心一般黑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說用稻草引火，可牢房裡哪來的稻草？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從墊子裡抽出來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你牢房裡的墊子是用棉線紡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我大概是記錯了……那便不是從墊子裡抽出來的，是那隻羽獸築巢的時候掉進來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事發後有人專門檢查過你的牢房，根本沒有看到什麼羽獸巢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是天底下壞人做完壞事都不記得抹除蹤跡，那還要大理寺和刑部做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好羽獸，真是通人性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對……還有引火的火花——是我用這副鐵鐐在牢房的欄杆上撞出來的，足足撞了八百六十三下，和大理寺成立的年數一樣多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我縱火的全部細節……夠仔細了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大理寺卿大人，還有問題要問嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"看來虞大人致仕這些年沒少聽評書。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要開玩笑……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是大理寺卿大人，竟然還有心思陪他一起裝瘋賣傻……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"這段你也要記下來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"有趣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"虞澄當年也是入選過大理寺浩然閣的少卿，多少貪官巨惡栽在了他的手裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"可自從他退休後，麟少卿以偽造證據的罪名將他治罪，他便變成了這副樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"現在再回想起來，麟少卿是否會後悔當初的選擇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在法律面前，沒有功過相抵的說法。解御史休要挑撥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，這虞澄當真奇怪，當年自己被指控偽造證據的時候，對那些卷宗不聞不問。案件已了判決已下，偏偏又要放這把火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不對……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我還有問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟少卿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哼。"},{"type":"narration","text":"麟青硯放下紙筆，卻正好迎上虞澄的目光。這個一直裝瘋賣傻的階下囚，此刻正緊緊盯著她。\n她想看清，她不怕被看清。\n虞澄似乎很滿意麟青硯的反應，他閉上眼，扯出一個難看的笑容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟少卿，作為代理書記官，你負責記錄就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"諶徹大人，有個問題您一直沒問。嫌疑人虞澄自稱是他燒了卷牘庫，那麼他的動機是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嫌犯的供詞分明是一派胡言，又何必問動機？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈……卷牘庫真是我燒的，你別不信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於我為什麼要燒……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虞澄！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"南區七萬四千冊卷宗，六十年苦心經營，大理寺二十四位少卿的心血，在你眼裡，當真和殘灰一般輕飄飄嗎？！"},{"type":"narration","text":"虞澄突然垂下頭，陷入久久的沉默。大理寺卿目不轉睛，盯緊了他的每個動作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼可惜的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些卷宗上寫的盡是些粉飾用的假話，看見它們髒我的眼，想起它們便髒我的心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乾脆一把火燒了，好不乾淨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乾淨……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底想說什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想說什麼？大理寺卿大人要是有興趣，不如我們就聊聊，燒掉的那些東西，到底乾不乾淨——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"諶徹大人，嫌犯看起來已經有些神志不清了，時候也不早了，今天的審決先到此為止怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來人，送虞澄回牢房。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慚愧，今天讓肅政院看了一場大理寺的笑話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"確實是件棘手的案子，在下理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個案子，大理寺一定會給肅政院一個交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……希望還是能快點解決，也好讓我少跑幾趟。你們這院子裡香樟樹種得太多，聞了總想打噴嚏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"麟少卿，告辭。我們改日再敘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也走吧，麟青硯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"決院大門被推開，日光重新灑下來，麟青硯一眼就看到了藏在樹影後的七座十八角尖頂塔樓。\n大理寺卷牘庫皆為此形制。這七座塔樓的尖頂上此時似乎都蒙了一層煙塵，那是被燒毀的南區的餘燼。\n正當她要邁出門去時，卻聽到了一聲輕呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"麟青硯，時候差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……別忘了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"麟青硯沒有絲毫停頓，一步邁進了毫無暖意的陽光裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g3_baizaomainstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"阿啾！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"解真御史，還沒有走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"等你，說兩句話。在裡面不方便講。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"麟少卿要是還想救……還想查明虞澄的案子的話，可要把握時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"百珍宴過後，百灶城中羈押的所有犯人，要嘛移監，要嘛發配，總之，還有半個月，獄中都要空出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"半個月……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"上頭的詔令應該馬上就傳到你們手裡了，我眼睛尖些，所以提前告訴你一聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為解真御史沒把這件事放在心上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"我姑且可以不放在心上，可是對麟少卿來說，虞澄也不是普通的前輩吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在大理寺，他算是我的半個老師……是他一步步教我成為一個明斷是非的大理寺少卿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他之前為扳倒貪官巨惡偽造證據，姑且能理解成是為了一個道義不擇手段……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我萬萬無法想像，他會做出火燒卷牘庫這種大逆不道的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊……這個老傢伙還真是讓人捉摸不透啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是話說回來……往年百珍宴也從來沒有這樣的陣勢，今年有何特殊之處？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"麟少卿即使不是相關之人，應該多多少少也聽說了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"年初玉門遇上一場天災，夏天的時候，又有大荒城的事變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"這些變故背後的原因，都指向一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……歲獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樁上千年的舊案，也要有個結果了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"不敢妄自揣測上意，我也只好言盡於此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……解真御史，剛剛為何要打斷審決？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"有道是，“耳聽為虛，眼見為實”。從嘴裡說出來的話，真假難辨啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"麟少卿應該還沒有看過卷牘庫的火災現場吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未曾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"或許還是去親眼看看的好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_041","isRemote":false,"text":"在下告辭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g1_yusrestaurant"},{"type":"narration","text":"片刻前熱熱鬧鬧的飯館此刻安靜無聲。\n飯館的熟客們彷彿早就料到了接下來的場面，紛紛逃出店外，卻沒有忘記留下飯錢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的少年","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老姜，關門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的少年","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老姜，她剛才是不是吃了這道桔紅酥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，對……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的少年","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位客人，你剛剛是不是說我做的這道桔紅酥不正宗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是……這位客人說的是“不一樣”，對，只是不一樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（賣力地使眼色）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的確說的是不正宗啊，而且確實沒有我吃過的好吃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，原來你就是這家飯館的大廚啊。還蠻年輕的嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別打岔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂，只是點評了一道菜而已，不用這麼較真吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且除了這道桔紅酥，我覺得別的菜都還蠻好吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別想跟我打馬虎眼！家有家法，店有店規！你今天不說明白我做的桔紅酥到底哪裡有問題，就別想走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是實話實說……這裡的桔紅酥和我過去吃過的味道就是不一樣啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是什麼時候在哪吃的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概……十幾年前？我在維多利亞的時候，家人寄給我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來砸場子的吧？老姜，趕人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，我們開店哪有趕客人走的啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位客人，您快想想，具體是什麼味道不一樣？興許是個誤會呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想想……我記得我吃過的桔紅酥比你做的要甜，嗯，你應該是糖放少了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"桔紅酥？多放糖？哈哈哈哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還當是哪裡來的美食家，原來是個木舌頭。我也沒什麼好和你吵的，走吧走吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還說別人是木舌頭，明明是你廚藝不精吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完……完了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我廚藝不精？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"笑話！我廚藝……我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好，我們就打個賭，你從這出去，在城裡逛一圈，你要是能找出一個做得比我好吃的，我把這家店賠給你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）使不得，使不得啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你要是找不到，就得坐在窗邊那桌，對著街上大聲喊一百遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喊什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然是跟我道歉啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我要你這個小店也沒用啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如這樣吧，要是我找到了，你就免了我在你這飯店裡一個月的飯錢，還得免費教我做幾道好吃的炎國菜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸什麼？炎國不是有句老話，授人以鱗不如授人以釣鱗竿嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這家小飯館我又帶不走，學會幾道菜，我回去後還能做給親朋好友吃呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你剛剛不還質疑我的廚藝……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都誇了別的菜做得好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等、等一下！別以為這樣就能騙過去了！這桔紅酥的事，還是得說清楚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，那我就和你打這個賭，我就不信這麼大的百灶城，找不到我吃過的那種桔紅酥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？哪來一股怪味？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像是廚房飄過來的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這味道我熟啊，是什麼東西燒焦了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我燉的湯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位客人，實在不好意思……我家大廚就這個脾氣，多有得罪，多有得罪……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次再來，下次再來哈……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文雅的女子","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說手藝高明的大廚，脾氣都會古怪點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文雅的女子","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位小大廚要不是這麼在意自己做的菜，想來也不會練就這一手廚藝吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文雅的女子","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有沒有注意到，你點的五道菜，豆腐切得大小形狀都不同，但同一道菜裡，又完全挑不出兩塊大小不一樣的豆腐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文雅的女子","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"單憑這一手刀工，百灶就沒有幾個廚師能做到吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你聽到我們吵架了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文雅的女子","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，在下不是有意偷聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文雅的女子","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是剛剛姑娘那一桌分享菜餚吃得熱鬧，你不小心拿去的那一盤桔紅酥，應該是在下點的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……！對不起對不起……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這算哪門子事……錯拿別人的吃的，還跟別人吵了一架……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你等等啊，我再去買一份！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文雅的女子","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，不用啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文雅的女子","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天本就是來這家小店裡做做考察。看到這裡的客人吃得這麼開心，那廚師的手藝一定也差不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文雅的女子","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過在下確實有些好奇，姑娘所說味道更正宗的“桔紅酥”到底是什麼口味？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……具體的我也說不上來，不過我確實記得，以前吃過的家人寄來的那種桔紅酥，就是更好吃一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文雅的女子","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘可以確定，那味點心的名字叫“桔紅酥”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年我家有人住在百灶，他經常寄這種點心給我，我不會記錯的……肯定不會記錯的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文雅的女子","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下有一個不情之請……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文雅的女子","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能否煩請姑娘，帶在下一同去尋找呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊！你是百灶本地人對吧？我正愁沒人帶路呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過今天時間不早了，明天中午，我們還在這裡碰面怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文雅的女子","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了！你也別一口一個姑娘地叫我了，我叫煌。是……維多利亞來的遊客。你叫什麼名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文雅的女子","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說來慚愧，在下平時喜好美食，也喜歡寫點文章。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"行箸","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我寫文章用的筆名叫“行箸散人”，你叫我行箸就好啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_i05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"總攬八方，歸藏萬卷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如此一座卷牘庫……竟為灰泥塚。"},{"type":"narration","text":"陰暗的空間裡還殘留著刺鼻的氣味。傾頹的格木梁柱上，污濁的雨珠搖搖欲墜。\n原本盛放卷宗書冊的鐵匣被烈火扭曲了形狀，紙墨在其中悶燃成灰，只剩下模糊的字痕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別待得太久，火後逢雨，多是污濁之氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有初步的調查結果了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可以斷定，是人為引起的火災。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"荒唐的是，調查結果顯示，起火的時間，還有起火點的位置，與虞澄口供中的細節絲毫不差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卷牘庫是大理寺重地，戒備森嚴。可是在案發之前，當晚的守衛無一人察覺到異樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"作案者不僅武功高強，還對大理寺相當熟悉，而且一定與虞澄早有串聯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您懷疑……是大理寺內部的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……無法下定論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"受損有多嚴重？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"被燒的全部都是陳年舊案，於現在的工作倒是無甚大礙。只是這些案件，將來要是再復審，就查無實據了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這些案子，基本每一樁，都是虞澄他親自負責的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"諶大人，您真的相信是虞澄放火燒的卷牘庫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……絕無可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他再如何裝瘋賣傻……身在獄中，他絕無可能自己動手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但這起事故和虞澄脫不了干係，一定有人與他合謀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可他為什麼要說……這裡的卷宗，都是“不乾淨”的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在懷疑什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您是否還記得……當年，虞澄在辭官之前，調查的最後一個案子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……很難不記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"四十年前，刑部尚書當街遇刺，兇手竟是一個瘋癲的老乞丐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大理寺用了一切辦法去查那個老乞丐的身分，卻一無所獲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這起案件審到最後，也只能當作臨時起意的暴力行兇來結案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是事隔近三十年，虞澄……指認當朝禮部尚書，寧述，是這起案子的兇手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我和虞澄共事了很多年，曾經的他是一個怎樣的人，我再清楚不過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是他在大理寺的最後幾年，我卻開始看不懂他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他變得激進偏私，查案也開始不擇手段。甚至拿出一些根本站不住腳的證據，去翻所謂的舊帳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果那些指控當真站不住腳，那寧尚書，為何會在當時辭官呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您是否還記得……顧筌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_u_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"起因是顧筌作為宣禮使，死在了去往維多利亞的途中……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虞澄認為，寧尚書不僅謀害了刑部尚書，還在三十年後謀害了那起案件的關鍵證人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不正是荒唐的地方，那名宣禮使入仕也沒多少年，談何與三十年前的舊案有關聯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且宣禮使是在接近維多利亞邊境的地區墜河而亡，死因明確，又怎能是遠在百灶的禮部尚書謀害？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那顧筌之死，大理寺記錄的檔案資料……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在你眼前，這些灰燼的某處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼提起這兩樁案子？你是懷疑，這兩件事與卷牘庫失火有關？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一種猜測……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虞澄自首引人注意，顯然，卷牘庫失火背後，某人有著更大的謀劃。問題不只在於是誰燒了卷牘庫，更在於，兇手的目的到底是什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這起案件，能否交給我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為何？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虞澄指名要讓你來做審決他時的筆錄，這是你現在站在這裡的原因，也是我不能讓你進一步參與的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管虞澄有什麼謀劃，你一定是其中的一環。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你視虞澄為師，不忍見他晚節如此，但卷牘庫失火案我會交給別人來查，會有一個結果的。你盡可放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那虞澄曾經追查的案子又該如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你最好忘掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不論你想查什麼，現在都不是一個好時機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這又是為何……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟青硯，你是大理寺少卿，不是一地巡捕，你經手的每一件案子，影響都不只在一人一事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自認為的正義之舉，很可能成為別有用心之人手裡的刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您知道這件案子背後牽扯到的事，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離虞澄的這起案子遠一點，這是我的建議，別讓它變成命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後一個忠告……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1613_1","isRemote":false,"text":"學會審時度勢，過去的事，永遠沒有當下的事來得重要。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"年輕的大理寺少卿依舊站在原地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她沿著前人鏟出的一條小道走進傾頹的梁柱下，那些熟悉的卷宗曾經就擺在那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"縱火之人目的明確，無外乎不想讓人再見到這些卷宗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論諶徹口中的虞澄是否弄虛作假，兩件案子僅存的線索都指向了寧述。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是一位禮部尚書，究竟因為什麼，才會對另一位一品大員痛下殺手呢？"},{"type":"narration","text":"她俯身撥開一截被燒斷的檩條，一點翠色從灰堆中冒了出來。\n一截松枝，其葉如針。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虞澄，難道你……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這棵松樹是我前往百灶就職前，親手栽下的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我死了，你砍下它。用它的木，做我的棺材。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g9_dalitemple"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"麟青硯，時候差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……別忘了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g1_yusrestaurant"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個月水費兩千、電費兩千五、食材……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去去去，要算帳上一邊算去，別在我耳朵邊上念叨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算下來……只要你再湊出三千塊，我們這小店這個月就還不至於會倒閉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能上哪湊出錢來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路子也不是沒有，東家王木匠賒的兩個月飯錢，西家劉掌櫃上個月白事辦席拖的尾款。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些零零碎碎的帳，隨便收一收也能應付過這個月了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……不太好吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那賒帳的客人，肯定多少有點難處……上門去討帳不太好開口的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要命要命！你願意當老好人，怎麼每回催租的來都要我應付？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你塊頭大！對面再生氣，也不至於打起來嘛……嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者……還有一個辦法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，鼎豐樓的人今天又來送比賽的請帖了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鼎豐樓籌備百珍宴，正在招廚師，能通過比賽考核的，光獎金就有好大一筆。拿到獎金後，我們到明年的房租都不用愁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不去！我才不去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是堂堂“餘味居”的老闆！大廚！跑去幫別人打工算怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不是一般人！鼎豐樓的總廚從不收徒，但他隨便露一手都夠一般廚師學個三年五載的，多少人想替他打工還沒機會呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何況還是去做百珍宴，每年百珍宴的菜譜，可都是記錄在案、流傳後世的。這是多少廚師的畢生夢想——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰愛去誰去，我才不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你該不會是害怕了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你才害怕！你才怕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼……什麼百珍宴，還不是一群老頭子老太太板著張臉開大會的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個個的滿肚子都是官家事，誰顧得上好好吃兩口飯，沒什麼意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好大的口氣，說得好像你去過一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我做過的宴席多了去了，你哪裡曉得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也不行那也不行，我看這小飯館還是倒閉算了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要命要命，攤上你這樣的老闆，還得提前幫自己謀後路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦好啦，不就是湊三千塊的事，月底前每天多送幾趟外送囉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……你說說你，做大廚不想著揚名立萬，當老闆也不想著多賺一點，真不知道你開這個飯館圖什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人要吃飯，那就得有人做飯，只要有人想要吃我這手藝，這飯館就得開下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我答應過要等的客人還沒有等到，這家小店可不能倒閉啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老姜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1621_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等人等人，一直說要等人。等的到底是什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是還不到時候嘛。什麼時間該下什麼料，要等火候，急不得的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"急不得啊……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g13_yanlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搞什麼，怎麼什麼頻道都收不到，還想看看新聞的說……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喲，回來啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"查到什麼了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幫你包了點吃的。我今天發現了一家小飯館，雖然廚師脾氣臭得要命，但手藝還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了對了，再跟你講件好玩的事，今天我還發現了好久以前，我爸寄給我過的一種點心——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……誰讓你隨便離開房間的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是吧，我都連吃了三天外送了。我就是去附近的小飯館裡吃頓飯，這也不行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你說了多少遍！你現在的身分十分重要，處境也很危險！你到底有沒有把這件事放在心上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟青硯！你還講不講理？我們當初約法三章，也沒說我連門都不能出吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在羅德島生活得好好的，是你突然找上我，神神秘秘地說我爸的死有蹊蹺，具體的事又什麼都不肯告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好不容易回到了百灶，就在我爸他以前生活過的地方，你還是什麼都不告訴我！每天就讓我待在這個小房間裡，你還對我發脾氣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……抱歉……我不該對你發火的。現在的情況，和我原本預想的有些不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼情況，我能幫上點什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道，我們抵達百灶前，這裡發生了很多預料之外的事情……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你若想幫我，那就記得這段時間，別讓自己置身於危險之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於你父親的案件……那是我在幾年前偶然接觸到的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那原本是一位我很信任的前輩在查的案子。你父親生前，似乎花了很多年在追查一個真相……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的死有疑點，每一條線索，都指向更大的背景。但是具體有多大，我現在也不知道，甚至猜不到……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你的存在本身，就是最關鍵的證據。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，我向你保證，我會查出來，等我查清這一切的時候，我一定會全部告訴你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在那之前，我只能懇請你相信我……我需要你的配合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你剛剛說，你父親怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說我吃到了一種我爸以前寄給我的點心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道是不是時間過去太久，和我記憶裡的味道不太一樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像這種情況，炎國話是不是叫“物是人非”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，是物不一樣了，人也不在了。是“人物皆非”才對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許該說……“時移世易”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間過去太久，再想找到過去的痕跡，何其困難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這是我能在百灶找到的，為數不多的與我爸有關的東西了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和我媽一起在維多利亞生活的時候，我爸還會時不時寄東西給我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時我還天真地相信，等我控制住病情，堅定自己的理想的時候，我爸應該也早就回維多利亞等著我回家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰不期待這樣的結局呢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可等我真的找到了治療礦石病的地方，陪小兔子他們一起做完許多事時，我爸卻早已不在了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你找到我之前，我一直以為我爸是死於意外，雖然很難過，可也的確做不了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果說我爸的死另有蹊蹺，那就完全不一樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道真相，因為我必須給我爸一個交代，也必須給自己一個交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實話實說，關於你父親的事情，我知道得極其有限。曾經的檔案資料遺失了許多，能從中提取的資訊寥寥無幾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從他遺留下的檔案資料來看，你父親他在禮部當了十幾年奉禮郎，一直沒得到升遷。從這一點來看，他似乎不是一個會做官的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這樣一個小官，他能當十幾年……他應該是個好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好人……好人一樣會死。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"大理寺少卿走向窗邊，閉上眼，揉捏兩側的鬢角。\n遠處繁華的燈光在暮色中閃爍，漂泊的年代已經遠去。\n眼下的人們從一段生活走向另一段生活，城市為他們指路，也跟在他們身後奔行。\n許多界限被模糊，許多高牆成通衢，許多匆忙的腳步從行道磚上踩過，不是每個人都有資格留下名字。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
